WEBVTT

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.740
It's no good!

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:22.990
What are you doing?

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:27.000
I was trying to turn back
into my human form.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.380
You sure are a little kooky, Michiru.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.420
Oh, right.
You've got a call from the city hall.

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:35.670
A call?

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.850
That's your Beastman Resident Certificate
and health insurance card.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:45.390
I saw it hadn't been processed yet,

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.980
so this is to thank you
for the Medi-Cen bombing case.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:49.900
I know you had a rough time.

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:51.310
Thank you.

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:54.280
Now you're an official resident
of Anima-City.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.990
Welcome to the beastman metropolis.

00:01:58.240 --> 00:01:59.070
Yes.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:00.740
Oh, that's right.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:02.700
You can have this back.

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.910
You can keep it.

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:07.330
But it's no use.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.960
<i>It doesn't connect to the Internet</i>
<i>in the outside world.</i>

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:14.300
<i>No matter what I do,</i>
<i>it just shows the city hall website.</i>

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:15.630
That's right.

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:18.760
According to the Special Beastmen
District Provision,

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:21.090
access to news
of the human world is restricted.

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:22.180
That's not fair!

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:26.140
Michiru, this is a good opportunity
for you to learn some things.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:33.360
Beastmen, or beast humans, are a different
human species than homo sapiens.

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.110
Due to special DNA,
beast deoxyribonucleic acid,

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:38.610
they can morph their bodies.

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:43.450
In ancient times,
they mimicked the animal deities

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.870
that each of the different tribes
worshiped.

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:48.870
They wanted to become like gods.

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:53.790
But the kind of animal they can morph into
is determined by their ancestors.

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:55.300
Lion cubs can morph into lions.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:59.760
<i>When they cross-marry,</i>
<i>the children gain only one parent's genes.</i>

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:03.090
<i>In this case,</i>
<i>either a lion or a tiger will be born.</i>

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.050
<i>They won't be born a liger.</i>

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:08.810
<i>For a human that doesn't carry</i>
<i>beast deoxyribonucleic acid,</i>

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:10.980
<i>turning into a beastman</i>
<i>is incomprehensible.</i>

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:13.440
But I did.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:17.570
Right. What couldn't possibly happen
has happened to you.

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:26.200
Beastmen have always avoided contact
with homo sapiens or humans.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:29.500
We've lived in forests, mountains,
uninhabited islands, and deserts.

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:32.670
But due to
human environmental development,

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.460
we had no choice but to show ourselves.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.460
Since the existence
of beast humans became apparent,

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:43.930
there have been many conflicts,
but Anima-City was finally established.

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:46.050
That's when you showed up.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:49.350
I had your DNA analyzed.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:51.640
It's different than
an ordinary beastman's.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:57.270
Whenever you morph, explosive
yet unstable cell division occurs.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:01.610
That's probably why you can
change your shape at will.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:03.660
Though it's still just a theory.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:04.910
Can I be cured?

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.410
I don't know yet.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.830
Give me a little more time.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:12.370
In the meantime,
let the Beast Co-op take care of you.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:13.370
Okay.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.880
I kind of understand,
but then again, I don't.

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:22.260
But I do understand this is useless.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:24.430
You there, Ms. Tanuki.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:26.090
Oh, it's the weasel.

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:27.050
I'm a mink!

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.350
Anyway, I got my hands on some nice stuff.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:30.770
Do you want to take a look?

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:32.180
No, thank you!

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:34.520
What are they?

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:40.110
Illegal mobile phones that can
penetrate the Anima-City firewall.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.030
If you need a SIM card,
I also have them at 50 percent off.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:45.990
But for a limited time only.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:47.780
Ten.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.620
-Nine. Eight.
-But I don't have any money!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.700
-Seven.
-Can I charge it?

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.290
Not to me, but to Shirou.

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:04.590
My daughter got upset with me,
so I switched to e-cigarettes recently.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:06.380
But those won't work here.

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:10.890
I swear it. I don't know who the goods
from Medi-Cen are going--

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:17.600
You've attracted Shirou Ogami's attention.
That's your problem.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:19.900
Tell me, Kusakabe,

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:23.820
how's a man who can't even settle
a problem going to give me satisfaction?

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:34.200
Flip, I've got business with that man.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.170
Hold your horses.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:41.630
I'm still not finished with my business.

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.010
Don't!

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:56.020
No!

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:07.650
It looks like your business is done too.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.200
LOG IN

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:17.460
FROM EVERYONE AT FACELOOK

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.630
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, MICHIRU!
LONG TIME NO SEE!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.630
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, MICHIRU!
HOW ARE YOU DOING?

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:38.230
<i>Isn't it crazy when you</i>
<i>have to go out without any notice?</i>

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:41.600
<i>For times like that,</i>
<i>let me recommend my favorite makeup.</i>

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:45.980
<i>You'll look elegant without much effort.</i>

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.570
There's a human living here?

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.160
<i>Today, I've used this for my foundation.</i>

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:00.210
<i>Excuse me!</i>

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.130
Excuse me.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.050
Are you--

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:16.350
What's going on?

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:17.770
Hey, punk.

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:20.730
Who told you to get near the little miss?

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.730
Who's "the little miss"?

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:25.940
In fact...

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:28.650
where the heck am I?

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:31.650
Don't play dumb!

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:37.410
You got close to her because you knew
she's the daughter of the Family.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.160
"The Family"?

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:43.120
<i>Could that be</i>

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:44.960
the name of that gang?

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.750
Looks like you know something.

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:50.470
Out with it!
Why'd you get close to the little miss?

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:53.590
You've got it all wrong!
I just saw her on Facelook--

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:55.050
Facelook?

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:57.180
You know Facelook?

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:01.060
I only just got here, so yes.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.940
You've been on the mainland?

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:05.610
No way! Awesome!

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:10.490
Really? Where? Tokyo?
Shibuya? Harajuku? Omotesando?

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.860
A little more rural.

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:15.200
My name's Nina! What's yours?

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:16.620
Michiru.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:19.080
Oh, you're actually a beastman.

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:22.000
You mean, I looked like a human?

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.830
Yes!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:26.630
On the Internet, I pretend to be a human.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:28.630
I'm a beastman playing a celebrity.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:29.960
Go away.

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:36.260
So who's your dad?

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.140
I hate my dad.

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.220
That's my grandpa.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:44.390
Dad says that before I was born,

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:47.770
he was captured by humans,
stewed in soy sauce and was eaten.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:48.690
That's crazy!

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:52.150
Yes, I know. That would never happen.

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:54.900
He caught me listening
to human music the other day,

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:56.660
so he won't let me go out now.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:59.080
He says it's indecent and evil.

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:02.120
Oh, that's right!
Let me show you something!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:05.080
These are my treasures!

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:09.040
Some I found washed up on the beach.
Others are souvenirs that I got.

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:12.000
Does it bring back memories?
You know what that is?

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.220
Just one of them washed up.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.340
The ones out there
don't have wires, do they?

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.950
I thought you were dieting
until the audition.

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:42.370
This is an exception.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.710
Michiru, you're not like the others.

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:52.630
When people come here, they don't
want to talk about life back there.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.010
Do you want to go back?

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.810
I can't go back looking like this.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.350
<i>I want to change back.</i>

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:13.650
Michiru?

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.530
Did I change back? I'm back?

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.030
How come?

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:22.830
I've got no tail,
so I can fit in tight places!

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:24.540
I can wear hats too!

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:31.670
That's right! This is the real me!

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.750
You've been morphed this whole time?

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:39.880
Oh, yes. I forgot
how to return to my human form.

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:41.970
Then you can go back now.

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:44.810
We can go to the mainland!

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:54.190
Nina!

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:57.150
Wait up, Nina!

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:00.820
You know what?

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:04.620
This girl named Lisa on Facelook
is hosting a party at her home.

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:07.120
She invited me to come.

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:10.290
Are you serious?

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:13.500
Climb on my back,
and we'll be there in no time.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.840
If we come back quick,
there won't be any trouble.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:20.090
Why do you want to go there so badly?

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:25.720
I can't stand knowing
only this town my whole life.

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:27.770
Also...

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.270
it's just so attractive!

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.370
Well, then, let's go.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:51.330
<i>Nina!</i>

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.670
Daddy is home!

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:57.000
Nina!

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:01.470
Nina?

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:03.930
I'm very sorry!

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:15.270
It was farther than I thought.

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:24.780
Oh, no! We've got to hide!

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:26.820
Why?

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:29.700
Some cops are in cahoots
with beastman hunters!

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:30.700
You there!

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:34.250
It's dark around here, so be careful.

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:39.250
You're freaking out way too much, Michiru.

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:41.010
How did you live here before?

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.430
That's where it is!

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:42.320
Michiru!

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:46.280
So this is what macaroons taste like!

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.780
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:53.790
Yes, I'm fine.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:57.410
You're glad you came, right?

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:00.380
Yes! I'm glad I could come back.

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.090
Is that you, Nina?

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.590
You're Nina, right?

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:09.390
You really did come!
I've never seen you in the flesh before.

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.600
Is that you, Lisa?

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:13.810
I've finally met you!

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:20.690
Oh, crap!

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:25.070
No way. You've got to be kidding!

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:29.490
You're a beastman, Nina?
And you're a dolphin?

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:30.570
You are so cute!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.240
-What?
-What?

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:33.950
Give me a hand, guys!

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:35.700
Right on!

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:37.750
Listen up, everyone!

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:41.670
We've got the perfect guest
for our beastman costume party!

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:44.500
The beastman, Nina!

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:50.550
Did you forget your costume? Have these.

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:55.390
We can't possibly imagine the pain
and suffering that Nina's experienced

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:58.020
fighting against discrimination.

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:00.060
It must have been difficult.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.150
No, I haven't--

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:07.280
Let's celebrate the courage and beauty
that Nina has displayed in her gutsy life!

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:20.960
Shirou! You've got a call!

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:22.830
Ogami.

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:26.090
Do you know where Michiru
is right now and who she's with?

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:29.550
She's partying with Flip's daughter
on the mainland.

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:34.010
If the Family finds out,
there will be trouble.

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.430
I will bring them back
before it causes a problem.

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:39.100
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:55.200
You idiot!
If you want to die, do it somewhere else!

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:57.160
I have business with Flip.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:02.370
I'm busy now. Out of the way.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:05.750
You plan on starting a war
with those human lowlifes?

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:07.960
So what if I am?

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:10.420
I'll bring your daughter back.

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:12.380
How did you know?

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.180
Either leave this to me

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:16.220
or fight me right now.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:18.100
It's your choice.

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:21.560
I'll wait until midnight.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:25.600
If she's not back by then,
I'll turn them all into hamburger meat.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.250
Did you see that?

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:45.420
Nina, let's go back.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:47.380
Why?

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:51.550
I don't know. It's just that
something seems wrong with this place.

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:54.760
This isn't where I wanted to return to.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:57.850
Why not? Everyone's so nice here.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:01.720
Or are you jealous
because I'm so popular with everyone?

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.560
Don't be silly!

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:06.900
Then why don't you tell them
you're a beastman too?

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:09.610
I'm not going back.

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:22.410
What the heck am I doing here?

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:29.130
Hello?

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:32.500
I don't care
if you want to leave Anima-City.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:33.960
Do as you please.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:34.880
ANIMARU

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:37.090
But bring back Flip's daughter right now!

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:39.800
What? How did you know about that?

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:42.890
<i>Flip's furious</i>
<i>and about to wage war on humans.</i>

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:46.390
<i>I'm headed for the harbor. Get her there.</i>

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:47.980
<i>Got it?</i>

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:49.980
Hey! You expect me--

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:56.400
You're leaving this to someone else?
Hell must be freezing over.

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:01.160
This is the first time
I've seen a real beastman!

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:02.620
Me too!

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:05.700
But you know, it's pretty scary, isn't it?

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:08.000
I mean, she's half-animal, right?

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:11.590
Yes! I could never live
with anything like that.

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:22.350
What are you doing?

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:26.680
Nina was tired, so I thought I would
put her in some seawater.

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:28.890
I mean, she's a dolphin, right?

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:34.900
Nina!

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:36.240
Nina!

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:14.520
Are you okay?

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.280
Let's go home.

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:39.420
Michiru,

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:41.260
I'm sorry.

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:44.890
-It's okay. I'm sorry too.
-What?

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:49.850
If we hadn't gone to the human world,
you wouldn't have suffered like that.

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:52.850
I wish I had stopped you.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:56.900
It's not like I hated it though.

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:01.820
I mean, I lived like a celebrity.

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:07.490
I guess you're right.

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:19.250
Didn't you want to go back there?

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:23.380
You bet I do.
Someday, I'll leave Anima-City.

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.640
But not yet.

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:29.680
I want to learn more about beastmen.

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:32.100
I think I need to know more.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:36.980
So for now, I want to stay in this town.

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:43.610
Besides, you charged something to me.
You must get a job and pay me back.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.280
What? Consider it a present for me!
It's my birthday today!

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:48.200
Who cares?

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:49.830
-Cheapskate.
-What did you call me?

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:51.950
-You scrooge wolf!
-You are a thieving tanuki.

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:53.120
I had to...

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:06.800
Transformative power greater than
any beastman and an immortal body.

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:10.260
They're certainly not
your ordinary beastmen.

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:12.310
Not those two.

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.330
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, MICHIRU.
FROM MOM

